@startuml
actor App as "Example App"
participant Model as "Qwen Model"
participant QNN as "QNN Backend"
participant Pass as "Pass Manager"
participant IR as "IR/Patterns"


App -> Model : Load config & tokenizer
App -> Model : Initialize QwenForCausalLM
Model -> QNN : Create ops

App -> Model : trace(input_ids, ...)
Model -> IR : Trace ops & tensors to IR
IR --> App : Traced IR

App -> Pass : Graph naming, rewriting and building
Pass -> IR :  Match patterns (Add, Linear, etc)

IR -> QNN : Build QNN graph nodes
QNN -> QNN : Graph Finalize

App -> Model : forward(input_ids, ...)
Model -> QNN : Execute QNN graphs
QNN --> Model : Output logits
Model --> App : Sampled tokens
@enduml
